Implement a small scanner:
```python
def _head(clause):
    depth = 0
    for m in re.finditer(r"[()]|: |;|,|\bwith\b|\bsuch that\b|\bwhere\b|\bof\b|\bletting\b", clause):
        tok = m.group(0)
        if tok == "(":
            depth += 1
        elif tok == ")":
            depth = max(0, depth-1)
        elif depth == 0:
            return clause[:m.start()]
    return clause
```
